From cea06a81d97b069a5e2e9a14e18bf3847ed2200e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tim James <tim@thewellnestcollection.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 20:13:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat: finder buttons, admin newsletter/finder tabs,
 collection map view, lat/lng support

- Navbar & hero buttons now link to /finder
- Admin dashboard: Newsletter Signups tab (name, email, date + CSV download)
- Admin dashboard: Finder Requests tab (all submissions + CSV download)
- Collection page: grid/map toggle with Leaflet + OpenStreetMap pins
- Clicking a pin shows mini property card popup
- Property form: latitude/longitude fields for map pin placement
- DB schema: lat/lng numeric columns on properties table
- API: lat/lng serialised in all CRUD endpoints

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
